{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12797","headline":"送巴州杨使君 · 韩翃","name":"送巴州杨使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白云县北千山口，青岁欲开残雪後。\n前驱锦带鱼皮鞮，侧佩金璋虎头绶。\n南郑侯家醉落晖，东关陌上着鞭归。\n愁看野马随官骑，笑取秦人带客旗。\n使者下车忧疾苦，豪吏销声出公府。\n万里歌钟相庆时，巴童声节渝儿舞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}